[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214688382","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109867#issuecomment-3214688382","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109867","id":3214688382,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_nEB-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T15:00:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T15:00:55Z","body":"Have you tested this using another, non-global node or class? This might not be a bug but the result of the handling of the reference for calling, for scope reasons, as `State.selected_model` is external to the current class it might be saved as a local variable","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214688382/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214981755","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109867#issuecomment-3214981755","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109867","id":3214981755,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_oLp7","user":{"login":"SiMeGH","id":117536539,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwF3Gw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117536539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH","html_url":"https://github.com/SiMeGH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T16:42:51Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T16:42:51Z","body":"No, I have not. I use globals a lot so I only sussed this particular case.\nMaybe it's not a bug but I don't know how to test that. My concern is what happens when you free the global variable when it is the last one referencing the resource.\nDoes a reference stay (a leak) or are both freed?\nI'm sorry if I can't help much beyond the code I provided (I simplified it as much as I saw possible).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214981755/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3215004343","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109867#issuecomment-3215004343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109867","id":3215004343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_oRK3","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T16:52:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T16:52:26Z","body":"Might still be a bug but would need some specific research, can test next week","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3215004343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3215058266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109867#issuecomment-3215058266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109867","id":3215058266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_oeVa","user":{"login":"SiMeGH","id":117536539,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwF3Gw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117536539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH","html_url":"https://github.com/SiMeGH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SiMeGH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T17:15:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T17:15:05Z","body":"I forgot to mention that I did test just to make if there was some frame delay where I pressed a button and it gave me the global variable reference count and the result was the same. Not sure if this helps. I just wanted to rule that out in case it was simply happening on the frame when it was creating the resource. It is persistent (doesn't matter which script or scene calls it).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3215058266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5762537583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109867#issuecomment-5762537583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109867","id":5762537583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABV3lYbw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T14:54:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T14:54:15Z","body":"This is not a bug. GDScript puts a reference to stuff on the stack in a lot of cases. Local vars and member variables might not do that as optimization, since we assume `self` and the stack to be valid until the function returns. So the additional reference is only there because you are calling something on the resource, and GDScript tries to ensure the resource is not freed while the call is running.\n\nSo there won't be any leaks from this, that can easily be verified by keeping track of the resource using a weak ref:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nvar t: WeakRef\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tState.selected_model = Model.new()\n\tt = weakref(State.selected_model)\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(0.5).timeout\n\tState.selected_model = null\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tprint(t.get_ref())\n```\n\nAfter half a second this will start printing `null` indicating that the resource was correctly freed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5762537583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]